ts/2020-election-results/2020-november-general-election.html"],[["2024"],"The State Election Board's certified summary of November 2024","The Board's archive lists an agenda and minutes for its certification meeting of 12 November 2024 but no meeting packet, and both are scans, so no certified summary of the 2024 figures can be read. The federal contests are compared with the Clerk of the House's statistics; every other 2024 contest rests on the Board's own precinct and county results files agreeing with each other, and carries no separate certified total.","https://oklahoma.gov/elections/about-us/meeting-notices-agendas-and-minutes-archives/2024-agendas-and-minutes.html"]]}